"This is environment TextWorldExpress."
You are in the kitchen. In one part of the room you see a stove. There is also an oven. You also see a fridge that is closed. In another part of the room you see a counter, that has nothing on it. In one part of the room you see a kitchen cupboard that is closed. There is also a cutlery drawer that is closed. You also see a trash can that is closed. In another part of the room you see a dishwasher that is closed. In one part of the room you see a dining chair, that has nothing on it. There is also a cushion. You also see a teapot. In another part of the room you see a dirty strainer. 
To the West you see the living room. 

Valid actions:
- inventory
- look around
- move west
- open cutlery drawer
- open dishwasher
- open fridge
- open kitchen cupboard
- open trash can
- take cushion
- take dirty strainer
- take teapot
